  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "兵、马、象、车被编进肉鸽小队，每枚棋子以独立移动方式和能力承担角色。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Assemble your forces from classic chess pieces including pawns, knights, bishops, rooks, and more. Each piece brings unique movement, abilities, and strategic possibilities.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "队伍不是可随意补充的棋堆，损失错误的关键棋子会直接改变整局路线。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Every piece matters. Losing the wrong unit can change the entire course of a run.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "棋盘、升级和遭遇每局随机重排，玩家要适应一盘不再遵守原规则的残破国际象棋。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "No two runs unfold the same way. Randomized boards, randomized upgrades, and unpredictable encounters ensure that every attempt offers new challenges and opportunities.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3298910/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
